  "label": "Queen Elizabeth II as a revered national icon",
  "description": "Queen Elizabeth II was the monarch of the United Kingdom and other Commonwealth realms, serving for over 70 years. She was a globally recognized symbol of stability, tradition, and national identity. Her image is often associated with dignity, formality, and historical continuity. The meme’s violent text juxtaposed with her image is intentionally jarring, as it contrasts her revered status with extreme hostility, making the abuse more shocking and provocative.",
